{"headword":"בַּרְזֶל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.19\">Ez 27:19</a> <strong>iron (</strong>c. ל afform.; from <em>piercing?</em> NH <em>id.</em>, Aramaic <em>id.</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּרְזֶל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܦܰܪܙܠܴܐ</span> Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">ברזל</span>, Assyrian <em>parzillu</em> COT<sup>Gloss</sup>, (Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">فِرْزِلٌ</span> <em>fetter</em> is loan-word)<strong>)</strong>—always abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:22\" href=\"/Genesis.4.22\">Gn 4:22</a> + 74 times (<span dir=\"rtl\">בַּרְזֶל֑</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:22\" href=\"/Genesis.4.22\">Gn 4:22</a> etc.);—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>iron</em>, lit.:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"iron-ore, stone containing iron, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.9\">Dt 8:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 28:2\" href=\"/Job.28.2\">Jb 28:2</a>;"}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as raw material (to be worked) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:22\" href=\"/Genesis.4.22\">Gn 4:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.3\">1 Ch 22:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 22:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.22.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.2\">29:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.7\">7</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.6\">2 Ch 2:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.12\">24:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.12\">Is 44:12</a>;"}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as article of commerce <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.12\">Ez 27:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.19\">19</a>;"}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as material of furniture, utensils, implements, etc., <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶרֶשׂ ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.11\">Dt 3:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶכֶב ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:16\" href=\"/Joshua.17.16\">Jos 17:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 17:18\" href=\"/Joshua.17.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:19\" href=\"/Judges.1.19\">Ju 1:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:3\" href=\"/Judges.4.3\">4:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:13\" href=\"/Judges.4.13\">13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּלֵי ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:19\" href=\"/Joshua.6.19\">Jos 6:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:24\" href=\"/Joshua.6.24\">24</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.7\">1 K 6:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:16\" href=\"/Numbers.35.16\">Nu 35:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵט־ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:24\" href=\"/Job.19.24\">Jb 19:24</a> & fig. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.1\">Je 17:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרִצֵי הַבּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.31\">2 S 12:31</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.3\">1 Ch 20:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַגְזְרוֹת הַבּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:31\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.31\">2 S 12:31</a> <em>cutting instr. of iron</em>, vid. <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:3\" href=\"/Amos.1.3\">Am 1:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּבְלֵי ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:8\" href=\"/Psalms.149.8\">ψ 149:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זִקִּים</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵשֶׁק ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:24\" href=\"/Job.20.24\">Jb 20:24</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנֵי ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.11\">1 K 22:11</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.10\">2 Ch 18:10</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קִיר ב׳</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲבַת ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.3\">Ez 4:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחֵי ב׳</span>, i.e. of Babylon, ag. Cyrus <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.2\">Is 45:2</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.7\">1 S 17:7</a> & <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.17\">Is 60:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (fig.)"}],"num":"d."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>tool</em> of iron <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.5\">Dt 27:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:31\" href=\"/Joshua.8.31\">Jos 8:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.17\">Pr 27:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:10\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.10\">Ec 10:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:34\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.34\">Is 10:34</a> (metaph.); head of an axe <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.5\">Dt 19:5</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:5\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.5\">2 K 6:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 6:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.6.6\">6</a>; so <em>weapon</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.7\">2 S 23:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 41:19\" href=\"/Job.41.19\">Jb 41:19</a>; cf. also <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:22\" href=\"/Numbers.31.22\">Nu 31:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:8\" href=\"/Joshua.22.8\">Jos 22:8</a> where iron as spoil of war."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>iron</em> in fig. of unwatered earth <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.23\">Dt 28:23</a>; of Egyptian bondage, <span dir=\"rtl\">כּוּר הַבּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.20\">Dt 4:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:51\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.51\">1 K 8:51</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.4\">Je 11:4</a>; of oppression <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹל ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:48\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.48\">Dt 28:48</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.14\">Je 28:14</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.13\">13</a>; of strength <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 15:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.15.12\">Je 15:12</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ב׳ מִנְעָלֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.25\">Dt 33:25</a> & <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:13\" href=\"/Micah.4.13\">Mi 4:13</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶרֶן ב׳</span>; of prophet, firm through Yahweh’s might, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַמּוּד ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.18\">Je 1:18</a>; of distress, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרִיחֵי ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:16\" href=\"/Psalms.107.16\">ψ 107:16</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:10\" href=\"/Psalms.107.10\">10</a> of judgments of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, & <a data-ref=\"Psalms 105:18\" href=\"/Psalms.105.18\">105:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁבֶט ב׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:9\" href=\"/Psalms.2.9\">ψ 2:9</a>; of evildoers, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.28\">Je 6:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.18\">Ez 22:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.20\">20</a>; simile of scorching sky <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.19\">Lv 26:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְטִיל ב׳</span> of bones of hippopotamus <a data-ref=\"Job 40:18\" href=\"/Job.40.18\">Jb 40:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּיד ב׳</span> of obstinate neck of Isr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.4\">Is 48:4</a>."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB01462","strong_numbers":["1270"],"next_hw":"בַּרְזִלַּי","prev_hw":"ברזות","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["1366"],"TWOT":["283a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}